{
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "nitwit_new_greeting_corner",
      "request": "greeting",
      "weight": 26,
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "line_0",
          "text": "Hello. I was keeping this corner company."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_1",
          "text": "Give the sunny corner some room. It gets shy around elbows."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_2",
          "text": "Step carefully near the sunny corner. I would rather greet you than patch you up."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_3",
          "text": "There you are. I was wondering who owned those footsteps."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_4",
          "text": "Morning. Or afternoon. The work makes the hours blur if I let it."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_5",
          "text": "Good to see you walking in calmly. That usually means nothing is on fire yet."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_6",
          "text": "If you need me, speak up. If you need gossip, speak quieter."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_7",
          "text": "You caught me before the next little disaster. That is rare timing."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_8",
          "text": "Hello. Try not to bring the whole village into this unless it is important."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_9",
          "text": "I have a moment. Not a long one, but a real one."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_10",
          "text": "Hello. I was thinking about corners."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_11",
          "text": "You arrived at a good time, unless you meant to arrive earlier."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_12",
          "text": "Hi. I am busy in a way that is hard to document."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_13",
          "text": "Careful where you stand. That shadow was using the spot."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_14",
          "text": "Hello there. I was just supervising the air."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_15",
          "text": "I have a moment. I had several, actually."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_16",
          "text": "Good to see you. I think I saw you first, unless you did."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_17",
          "text": "Come closer if you are not carrying a serious face."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_18",
          "text": "I was watching a barrel. It blinked first in spirit."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_19",
          "text": "Hello. The day seems mostly assembled."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_20",
          "text": "If you need help, I can point with confidence."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_21",
          "text": "You caught me between thoughts. Wide space, that."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_22",
          "text": "Stand anywhere. I have not assigned the ground today."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_23",
          "text": "Hi. Did you bring news or just footsteps?"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_24",
          "text": "I am listening with both ears and a spare guess."
        },
